sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API
    participant Ledger
    participant Planner
    participant Tools
    participant Verifier

    Client->>API: ask question with budget
    API->>Ledger: reserve step budget
    Ledger-->>API: remaining calls
    loop while calls remain and gain above threshold
        API->>Planner: propose next step
        Planner-->>API: tool and arguments
        API->>Ledger: charge step
        API->>Tools: execute tool
        Tools-->>API: page spans
    end
    API->>Verifier: check claimed values
    Verifier-->>API: verified spans or none
    API-->>Client: answer with spans or refusal
    API-->>Client: trace id and cost
